{"id": 982527, "slug": "sacrifice-for-sale", "name": "Sacrifice For Sale", "name_original": "Sacrifice For Sale", "description": "Sacrifice For Sale is a spooky Visual Novel in which you try to convince cultists not to sacrifice you.<br/><br/>Experience interaction in a new and engaging way. Choose to respond to what the characters have to say… directly! Deal with your own hostage situation, negotiate for more than just your freedom. Learn about the people who hold you captive, deconstruct the cult, manipulate them- all to not end up as their next sacrifice.<br/><br/><br/><br/>Learn the value of silence! You will never speak a word unless you actively choose to. The entire game can be played as a silent protagonist. Let others speak without interrupting them, give meaningful silent looks and get caught up in your own inner dialogue to reveal new options. Or you could always give in to apathy, accept your faith and be willingly sacrificed!<br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><ul><li> A short but immersive story<br/></li><li> Play as an ordinary Salesman just trying to get by<br/></li><li> Argue why the cultists shouldn’t sacrifice you<br/></li><li> 30 minutes for most single playthroughs<br/></li><li> 30'000+ words! <br/></li><li> 500+ choices! There's a choice around every corner!<br/></li><li> 15+ Unique Endings!</li></ul><br/><br/><br/>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2024-05-24", "tba": false, "updated": "2024-05-27T07:38:44", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/49d/49d3d2080d018dcc55633a7bc181526d.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/d93/d93ea2f269b2f8afc6fb82b2bdc69e29.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 8, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_desc